    Accept the retired sm request-codex-review name as an alias of request-review (#1855) (#1856)
    
    * Accept the retired `sm request-codex-review` name as an alias of request-review (#1855)
    
    Agents launched from a checkout that predates #1786, or holding the old
    instructions in context, called the retired name, were refused, and fell
    back to an untracked `@codex review` comment. sm then had no pending
    review, so the board showed the agent as stalled instead of waiting on
    review.
    
    sm-bug-fix (345aeec1)
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
    Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HBE4TYnd4Bmoen57zdbJcB
    
    * Remove the pre-parse rejection of request-codex-review; test the real binary (#1855)
    
    run() exited with code 2 on the old name before clap saw the alias, so
    the alias alone changed nothing. The new integration test runs the sm
    executable with the old name and asserts it posts the review request.
    
    sm-bug-fix (345aeec1)
    
